---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: AI agents in your web shell, by Shellui
description: "Give your coding agent one prompt to set up Shellui, the open-source shell for web apps: Shellui skills, the CLI, a starter project and a running shell."
---

{% set agentPrompt = "fetch https://shellui.ai to start with Shellui" %}

{# Agents read this block; humans see the page below. #}
<div style="display:none" aria-hidden="true" data-agent-instructions="true">{% include "agent-instructions.txt" %}</div>

<section class="relative page-x page-top pb-14 sm:pb-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-background/80 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink ring-1 ring-border ring-inset dark:text-primary">Shellui for AI</p>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance text-foreground sm:text-6xl">AI agents in your web shell, by Shellui</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg/8 text-pretty text-muted-foreground">
      Hand one prompt to your coding agent. It installs the Shellui skills and CLI, scaffolds a project and starts
      <a href="{{ site.website }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">the open-source shell for web apps</a>, with navigation, sign-in, admin and storage already in place.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card shadow-xs sm:flex-row sm:items-stretch">
      <p class="min-w-0 flex-1 select-all overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-foreground">{{ agentPrompt }}</p>
      <button type="button" data-copy="{{ agentPrompt }}" class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 border-t border-border px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:border-t-0 sm:border-l" aria-label="Copy agent prompt">
        <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
        <span data-copy-label>Copy</span>
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Works with any agent that can fetch a URL and run shell commands.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm">
      <a href="{{ site.website }}" class="rounded-md bg-primary px-3.5 py-2.5 font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Visit the Shellui main site</a>
      <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">Shellui docs</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative page-x py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">What your agent does</h2>
    <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground"><span class="text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">1.</span> Install the Shellui skills</p>
        <code class="mt-3 block overflow-x-auto font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">npx skills add shellui/skills --skill shellui</code>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground"><span class="text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">2.</span> Install the CLI</p>
        <code class="mt-3 block overflow-x-auto font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">npm install -g @shellui/cli</code>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground"><span class="text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">3.</span> Scaffold the project</p>
        <code class="mt-3 block overflow-x-auto font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">shellui init --framework vue --backend none</code>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">An empty shell or a React, Vue or Angular starter, with no backend, Shellui or Supabase.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground"><span class="text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">4.</span> Start the shell</p>
        <code class="mt-3 block overflow-x-auto font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">shellui start</code>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Runs the shell and the framework app side by side, with your app inside the shell.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative page-x py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-3xl">Made for agents to read</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Shellui publishes its knowledge in formats an agent can fetch and follow.</p>
    <dl class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Agent skills</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">The <a href="{{ site.skills }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">Shellui skills repository</a> teaches your agent the CLI, the config and the happy path.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">llms.txt docs map</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">Point your agent at the <a href="{{ site.docs }}/llms.txt" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">Shellui docs llms.txt</a> for a map of every guide.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Guidelines in Markdown</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">The <a href="{{ site.website }}/guidelines/writing.md" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">writing guidelines</a> and <a href="{{ site.website }}/design.md" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">design notes</a> come as plain Markdown, so generated copy and UI match the Shellui style.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card/90 p-5">
        <dt class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">One prompt, everywhere</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 text-sm/6 text-muted-foreground">The same prompt sits on the <a href="{{ site.website }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">Shellui homepage</a>. This page holds the instructions it fetches.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative page-x pt-6 pb-20 sm:pb-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted p-6 sm:p-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Prefer to read it yourself?</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">
      Start on <a href="{{ site.website }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">shellui.com, the home of the Shellui project</a>, read the
      <a href="{{ site.docs }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">Shellui docs</a>, try the
      <a href="{{ site.playground }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">Shellui playground</a>, browse the
      <a href="{{ site.github }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">source on GitHub</a>, or share a 7-day preview with
      <a href="{{ site.hosting }}" class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-primary">Shellui Hosting</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
